<%- include partials/header.ejs %>
<%- include partials/main_nav.ejs%>
<div class="container mt-4 mb-5 pb-5">
    <div class="text-center mb-3">
        <h1><%= title %></h1>
        <p class="lead">Projects I have worked on</p>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4">
        <!--Projects-->
        <div class="col-md-10 mx-auto">
            <div class="card p-4 shadow-sm">
                <div class="row align-items-center">
                    <div class ="col-md-7">
                        <h4 class ="card-title">Packet Tracer Project 1</h4>
                        <p class ="card-text">Using Cisco Packet Tracer, I designed and implemented a multi-building corporate network architecture connecting Building 1, Building 2, and Building 3 via dedicated core and remote site routers. I configured static and dynamic routing protocols to ensure  end to end communication across all clients and gateway servers.</p>
                    </div>    
                     <!--Place image to the side of the text-->
                    <div class="col-md-5">
                        <img src="/Images/Packettracer1.png" class="img-fluid rounded" alt="Packet Tracer Project 1 Topology">
                        
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-10 mx-auto">
            <div class="card p-4 shadow-sm">
                <div class="row align-items-center">
                    <div class ="col-md-7">
                        <h4 class ="card-title">Financial Literacy game</h4>
                        <p class ="card-text">Using Python, I created an interactive financial literacy game designed to teach essential money management and budgeting skills. Players navigate various real life financial scenarios, making strategic decisions that directly impact their in game health, savings, and financial stability, reinforcing practical economic awareness through gamification.</p>
                    </div>
                     <!--Place image to the side of the text-->
                    <div class="col-md-5">
                        <img src="/Images/Budget quest.png" class="img-fluid rounded" alt="Budget Quest Game Introduction">
                        
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-10 mx-auto">
            <div class="card p-4 shadow-sm">
                <div class="row align-items-center">
                    <div class ="col-md-7">
                        <h4 class ="card-title">Packet Tracer Project 2</h4>
                        <p class ="card-text">Developed a network in cisco packet tracer for, a company that had been formed by the merger of four major companies across North America. The architecture spanned four core branch locations: Chicago Headquarters(manufacturing, distribution, and management),Vancouver Branch handling (internal/external server farms), Toronto Branch (sales department), and Mexico Branch (research & development).</p>
                    </div>    
                     <!--Place image to the side of the text-->
                    <div class="col-md-5">
                        <img src="/Images/Packettracer2.png" class="img-fluid rounded" alt="Packet Tracer Project 2 Topology">
                        
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-10 mx-auto">
            <div class="card p-4 shadow-sm">
                <div class="row align-items-center">
                    <div class ="col-md-7">
                        <h4 class ="card-title">Event management system</h4>
                        <p class ="card-text">With Object-Oriented Programming (OOP) principles in Python, I created a modular event management system that is  adaptable for any type of corporate or social gathering. By utilizing well defined classes, inheritance, and encapsulation, the code is highly reusable, has a clean structure, and efficient data handling for attendees, venues, and scheduling. </p>
                    </div>    
                     <!--Place image to the side of the text-->
                    <div class="col-md-5">
                        <img src="/Images/Event system.png" class="img-fluid rounded" alt="Event Management System Landing Page">
                        
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
<%- include partials/footer.ejs %>   